# Vampire Lord — less-fussy collaboration

Joe wants **speed over granularity** for Vampire Lord.

## Defaults

- Ship **feature packs**, not micro-PRs for every letter/tuning tweak.
- After a milestone card is confirmed, **do not ask again** for polish/QoL inside that card — just ship.
- Prefer one draft PR per pack; merge when Joe says merge.
- RUNTIME VERIFY once at pack end, not after every fix.

## In-game playtest defaults (code)

Campaign activate turns ON:

- AutoFortify (sandbags, no Accept letter)
- Playtest Pace (~1 day between waves, short warning)
- Quiet Letters (skip harvest / fortify-complete spam)

Joe iterates via `VL_prep` save + Dev Mode **Trigger Wave** / **Force Fortify**. See `mods/vampire-lord/docs/PLAYTEST_FIXTURE.md`.

## What still needs a human pick

- Starting a **new** milestone from the parked table (Approach Lanes / UI / Prisoners / Dark Boons)
- Merging PRs when Joe says merge
- Marking RUNTIME VERIFIED when Joe confirms a live session
